WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.171
Sid played in the pond.

2
00:00:07.172 --> 00:00:16.661
Tor sat on the rock.

3
00:00:16.662 --> 00:00:19.978
"I want to swim," Rex said.

4
00:00:19.979 --> 00:00:24.645
"The pond is mine!" Sid said.

5
00:00:24.646 --> 00:00:28.290
Sara looked at the rock.

6
00:00:28.291 --> 00:00:33.421
"Don't come near my rock!" Tor said.

7
00:00:33.422 --> 00:00:41.228
Everyone stomped and roared.

8
00:00:41.229 --> 00:00:44.526
The small dino tried to leave.

9
00:00:44.527 --> 00:00:49.920
Her branch shook.

10
00:00:49.921 --> 00:00:54.021
An acorn hit Rex. Bonk!

11
00:00:54.022 --> 00:00:57.689
"Ouch!" Rex looked up.

12
00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:01.752
The small dino gulped.

13
00:01:01.753 --> 00:01:04.565
"Please don't be mad!"

14
00:01:04.566 --> 00:01:08.819
"Huh?" Rex was confused.

15
00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:12.854
The dino got down.

16
00:01:12.855 --> 00:01:15.982
"I'm Eppie," the dino said.

17
00:01:15.983 --> 00:01:19.777
"I made the acorns fall.

18
00:01:19.778 --> 00:01:22.939
But I didn't mean to!"

19
00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:26.121
"See?" Sid cried.

20
00:01:26.122 --> 00:01:30.232
"I didn't make the acorn fall!"

21
00:01:30.233 --> 00:01:38.262
Everyone laughed.

22
00:01:38.263 --> 00:01:44.288
"Sorry, Sid," Rex said.

23
00:01:44.289 --> 00:01:48.438
Everyone else said sorry too.

24
00:01:48.439 --> 00:01:52.371
Eppie looked up at the buddies.

25
00:01:52.372 --> 00:01:58.138
"Can I, um, play with you?"

26
00:01:58.139 --> 00:02:13.454
The buddies smiled. "Yes!"

